  "description": "A universally recognized icon associated with death, danger, or extreme negativity. In popular culture and memes, it is frequently used as a visual metaphor to convey intense feelings such as despair, exhaustion, or grim resignation. Its use here is not literal but symbolic, mapping the emotional state of Monday morning dread onto the visual language of mortality.",
